('0503415c-22f5-5880-9ffa-08ac26ec7a42'::uuid,'ZQ-0380','womens-health','gynaecology','A 27-year-old woman in Geelong, Vic, has a thin, grey, malodorous vaginal discharge that is worse after intercourse. She has no itch or dysuria. The vulva and cervix look normal.

